| Researcher | Module | Shift | Specialty |
|---|---|---|---|
| Ines | Observatory | morning | geology |
| Kofi | Hydroponics | dusk | chemistry |
| Mara | Comms | afternoon | medicine |
| Tomas | Lab | night | botany |
